ue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Feature Request: Default support for UNIT test cases for Solidity should be Hardhat or Foundry**\r\n\r\nAs of now, when I ask CoPilot chat to create unit test case for a selected solidity function, it defaults to TRUFFLE framework which has been deprecated back in 2021. Details [HERE](https://archive.trufflesuite.com/blog/sunsetting-truffle-teams/)\r\n\r\nIn order to be up-to-date with the currently active testing framework in web3 for smart contract development, the Co-Pilot chat should provide support for either Foundry(the most widely used at the moment) or at least Hardhat.\r\n\r\nFurthermore, the chat in not capable of creating unit test cases for [Foundry framework](https://book.getfoundry.sh/forge/writing-tests) in solidity which is the most widely used test framework for smart contract developers as of now.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"854\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/assets/42082608/7f6eb963-ff03-4c90-98b2-6de7c6028dfe\">","closed_by":{"login":"dmitrivMS","id":9581278,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1ODEyNzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9581278?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS","html_url":"https://github.com/dmitrivMS","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS/received_events","type":"User","us